(text "R1–R16: 100 Ω per charlieplex line (keeps the common anode pin < 20 mA).\nPA7 = ADC: charge-sharing capacitive touch on the star (hover / touch / press / squeeze).\nR19 1 kΩ: ESD protection for the exposed star (EN 61547).\nSWD pins PA13/PA14 double as lines L8/L9: program with connect-under-reset (TP3, TP5, TP6).\nPF4/BOOT0 = line L15: its reset pull-down keeps boot-from-flash; firmware then floats it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "62e6302d-8aff-5d5e-bf94-95f3213f06f9"))
